    <comment>Update to 0.5.11

37 new documented nodes (TRELLIS 2, 3D mesh editing, ByteDance Seedream
V3, FishAudio, Flux video upscale); 431 existing en.md refreshed and
translations regenerated for all 12 locales.</comment>
