  <revision rev="3" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>bc480ba58ccf0bdcf7952c8c922d8800</srcmd5>
    <version>0.5.12</version>
    <time>1790112304</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>Update to 0.5.12.

Documented-node directories grow from 947 to 1018: 71 added, none
removed, plus 4805 pre-existing files revised across English and 11
locales. The added set includes the Bria, Tripo and Pixverse V6
families.

Independent of the rest of the comfyui train and can land at any point.
Factory's comfyui 0.36.0 requires &gt;= 0.5.11, which 0.5.12 satisfies, and
the payload is pure data read through importlib.resources, so the
addition is purely additive.

Built and checked locally on aarch64: rpmlint 0 errors, 0 badness. The
two python-doc-in-package warnings are structural to a package whose
entire payload is documentation. Verified on the artefact: rpm -qlp
counts exactly 1018 node directories, and no file ships executable.</comment>
    <requestid>1379748</requestid>
